Z||000012||Kelvin Vivian||04-19-2001||02:06 PM||||Good stuff...<P>All I can think of adding is...<P>1984/1985:<BR>Years that headrest speakers were available in seats.<P>1987/1988:<BR>Headlight assembly revised.<P>1988:<BR>15 in rims have different widths (6 in front; 7 inch rear)<BR>T-tops available as factory option.<p>[This message has been edited by Kelvin Vivian (edited 04-19-2001).]||||reg||10
