Z||000018||Indiana_resto_guy||04-19-2001||07:46 PM||||ALL '88 models did NOT hav monochrome paint. GT's and the Western Packages only.<BR>'88 dukes have the oil filter inside the oil pan. (some late run '87's as well)<P>StuGood- - - - '87 & '88 Pontiac on rear bumper, red and chrome.<P>When were the lumbar seats offered?<BR>'84 front suspension was already in production in the Chevette (YUK!)||||reg||1
