Z||000027||Tryxalon||04-19-2001||11:32 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Galen:<BR><B>I love muh lotus suspension uh huh. Of course, I feeel bad that I got outhandled by a damned stationwagon the other day.. I should have read that automoble article.. and belived it.. hehe j/k<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hmmm. Do ya think that could have been the fault of the driver rather than the suspension?? <P> I know MY 85 SE Fiero (mit Duke) handles better than the 63 Lotus Europa, 67 MGB or the 80 Fiat X1/9 I used to have and I would put it on par with a Lotus Elite. <P>Guess I didn't read the article?  But didn't that article complain that the Fiero handled badly??? Maybe you and the Car and Driver Magazine test Driver went to the same driving school??   <P>(just "razzin' a bit"!!   No harm meant!! snicker, snicker) ||||reg||6
