Z||000033||Kelvin Vivian||04-20-2001||01:53 PM||||Galen, <P>You crack me up, good catch on the 87 rear fascia having only one exhaust cut-out, whereas the 88s have an exhaust cut-out on both sides for all coupes.<P>Songman, et. al.,<P>As far as the rear "PONTIAC" logo, I thought that the revised 87/88 coupe bodies, including 88 Formulas, had the raised logo in the rear. <P>GT fastback rear fascias do not have the rear embossed "PONTIAC" logo. <P>The rest of the Fiero lineup for all years should have the embossed/debossed "PONTIAC" logo in the rear.||||reg||1
