Z||000035||Songman||04-20-2001||09:33 PM||||Well, when I am wrong, I say I am wrong.. I haven't seen my 88 in a while since it broke a cam gear after Christmas and it has been in storage. I went and looked at it today and guess what... chrome. If anyone needs to know how crow tastes, feel free to ask...<P>It was my older cars with embossed letters. That is what I get for not having any running Fieros at the house right now.<P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
